---
import PolicyLayout from '../layouts/PolicyLayout.astro';
---

<PolicyLayout
  title="Shipping Policy"
  description="Information about preparation, dispatch and delivery of Vaishali Foods orders."
>
  <section>
    <h2>Order preparation</h2>

    <p>
      Vaishali Foods prepares products freshly on demand before packing and
      dispatch.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Shipping rates</h2>

    <p>
      We ship from Nanded, Maharashtra (431605) via Delhivery Surface.
      Delivery charges depend on your destination zone and the chargeable
      weight of your order (actual weight or volumetric weight, whichever
      is higher). The first 500 g is charged at the base fare, and every
      additional 500 g slab is charged at the additional-slab fare:
    </p>

    <ul>
      <li><strong>Zone A, Local (same city):</strong> &#8377;35.40 base + &#8377;34.22 per extra 500 g</li>
      <li><strong>Zone B, Regional (within about 500 km):</strong> &#8377;38.94 base + &#8377;37.76 per extra 500 g</li>
      <li><strong>Zone C, Metro to Metro:</strong> &#8377;51.92 base + &#8377;49.56 per extra 500 g</li>
      <li><strong>Zone D, Rest of India:</strong> &#8377;61.36 base + &#8377;57.82 per extra 500 g</li>
      <li><strong>Zone E, Special zones (Jammu, Himachal, North East):</strong> &#8377;75.52 base + &#8377;71.98 per extra 500 g</li>
      <li><strong>Zone F, Special zones (Kashmir, Manipur, Ladakh, Andaman &amp; Nicobar):</strong> &#8377;88.50 base + &#8377;84.96 per extra 500 g</li>
    </ul>

    <p>
      The exact charge for your PIN code is calculated automatically at
      checkout before payment.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Delivery timelines</h2>

    <p>
      Delivery normally takes approximately 3&#8211;7 business days after dispatch depending on your location.
    </p>
  </section>
</PolicyLayout>